select app.guide_release_section('va', 'demo-portals', 'chapter', 'shared-tools', 'Me > **Demo portals** opens a demo renter portal and a demo owner portal with made-up data. Pick a stage to see exactly what the renter or the owner sees then: the next step, the countdown to pickup, the step tracker, the money and the emails and texts they get. Nothing you press there is saved or sent, so use it to learn each process or to walk a customer through theirs on the phone.

On a booking''s Overview, **From sale to pickup** shows the steps to close the sale and get the customer ready: request answered, offer accepted, agreement signed, paid, licence and coverage checked, deposit and drivers, car prepared, picked up. The step to do now is marked, with **Go there**; a step that waits on the renter says so, so you know to nudge them.

## The game in Rewards

Rewards has **Today''s game**: press **Play now** and one of the discount games (the wheel, a scratch card, blackjack and the others) shows your prize. Every game wins CarmaCars Rewards points, never a discount code: 10 to 250 points, drawn by the site, not by the game. One game a day (Admins set how many). Your points go to your own Rewards account (as a renter); if you have never rented with us they are saved and move there by themselves when you do. Points are never cash: they come off a rental charge only, from 500 points, like every other Rewards point. A test account plays but earns nothing.', 'Demo portals and the game in Rewards', 'See each process as a customer does; play for points.',
  'Me > Academy > **Demo portals** opens a demo renter portal and a demo owner portal with made-up data. Pick a stage to see exactly what the renter or the owner sees then: the next step, the countdown to pickup, the step tracker, the money and the emails and texts they get. Nothing you press there is saved or sent, so use it to learn each process or to walk a customer through theirs on the phone.

On a booking''s Overview, **From sale to pickup** shows the steps to close the sale and get the customer ready: request answered, offer accepted, agreement signed, paid, licence and coverage checked, deposit and drivers, car prepared, picked up. The step to do now is marked, with **Go there**; a step that waits on the renter says so, so you know to nudge them.

## The game in Rewards

Rewards has **Today''s game**: press **Play now** and one of the discount games (the wheel, a scratch card, blackjack and the others) shows your prize. Every game wins CarmaCars Rewards points, never a discount code: 10 to 250 points, drawn by the site, not by the game. One game a day (Admins set how many). Your points go to your own Rewards account (as a renter); if you have never rented with us they are saved and move there by themselves when you do. Points are never cash: they come off a rental charge only, from 500 points, like every other Rewards point. A test account plays but earns nothing.',
  '<p class="gd-p">Me &gt; Academy &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Demo portals</b> opens a demo renter portal and a demo owner portal with made-up data. Pick a stage to see exactly what the renter or the owner sees then: the next step, the countdown to pickup, the step tracker, the money and the emails and texts they get. Nothing you press there is saved or sent, so use it to learn each process or to walk a customer through theirs on the phone.</p><p class="gd-p">On a booking&#39;s Overview, <b class="gd-ui">From sale to pickup</b> shows the steps to close the sale and get the customer ready: request answered, offer accepted, agreement signed, paid, licence and coverage checked, deposit and drivers, car prepared, picked up. The step to do now is marked, with <b class="gd-ui">Go there</b>; a step that waits on the renter says so, so you know to nudge them.</p><section class="gd-task" id="demo-portals-the-game-in-rewards" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The game in Rewards</h2><p class="gd-p">Rewards has <b class="gd-ui">Today&#39;s game</b>: press <b class="gd-ui">Play now</b> and one of the discount games (the wheel, a scratch card, blackjack and the others) shows your prize. Every game wins CarmaCars Rewards points, never a discount code: 10 to 250 points, drawn by the site, not by the game. One game a day (Admins set how many). Your points go to your own Rewards account (as a renter); if you have never rented with us they are saved and move there by themselves when you do. Points are never cash: they come off a rental charge only, from 500 points, like every other Rewards point. A test account plays but earns nothing.</p></section>');
