> Good to know: The agreement is signed here, with the e-signature (never on paper).


## How the business is growing

Your Home shows the business''s traction: monthly active users of the website and of the app, and the days rented each month, with the change on the month before and the last 12 months. The figures come from the site''s own records and fill in by themselves.',
